  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 902.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 902.02 Applicability.\n\n(a) This part shall apply only to the particular watershed identified in the introductory paragraph(s) of each section.\n\n(b) The rules in Env-Dw 902.01 through Env-Dw 902.06 shall apply to Env-Dw 902.07 through Env-Dw 902.35.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 902) #10602, eff 5-20-14; ss by #13826, eff 10-26-21",
